WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.900
A ball, a can, a plank.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:05.910
Every object has one special point.

3
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.360
It's the single point where the whole
mass can be treated as concentrated.

4
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.970
For a uniform ball, can or plank,
it sits right in the middle.

5
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:18.400
So surely it must lie
somewhere inside the material?

6
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.900
Or can it sit at a point where
there is no material at all?

7
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:26.800
In this mission, you'll find this point for
shapes that are uniform and symmetrical.

8
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:31.640
Then you'll test it on a rod made half
of steel and half of a lighter metal.

9
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:36.130
Your mission: decide whether that point
can ever lie where there is no material

10
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.190
at all, and explain why.
